{"seq":1,"slug":"aria-roles","title":"ARIA 角色与属性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/aria/aria-roles","wordCount":1315,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"aria-角色与属性\">ARIA 角色与属性</h1><p>ARIA 是一把双刃剑。用对了,它能让原生 HTML 无法表达的复杂控件对屏幕阅读器清晰可读;用错了,它会主动覆盖掉浏览器原本正确的语义,制造出比不加更糟的体验。W3C 的实测数据反复印证一个结论:页面里 ARIA 用得越多,可访问性问题反而越多——不是因为 ARIA 不好,而是因为它常被误用。理解它的边界,比记住它的属性更重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WAI-ARIA(Accessible Rich Internet Applications)是一套 HTML 属性,作用单一而明确:<strong>修改<a href=\"../foundations/semantic-html\">基础章里那棵可访问性树</a></strong>——改节点的角色、附加状态、建立关系,从而改变辅助技术朗读出来的内容。当前稳定版本是 WAI-ARIA 1.2(2023 年 6 月成为推荐标准),1.3 仍在草案阶段(来源:<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/standards-guidelines/aria/\">W3C WAI-ARIA Overview</a>)。</p>\n<p>最关键、也最反直觉的一点:<strong>ARIA 只改语义,不改一行行为</strong>。给 div 加 <code>role=&quot;button&quot;</code>,屏幕阅读器会把它念成「按钮」,但它仍然不能聚焦、不能用回车触发、点击不会有任何效果——这些都得自己用 JS 补回来(详见<a href=\"keyboard-focus\">键盘与焦点管理</a>)。ARIA 是一张「语义贴纸」,不是功能。</p>\n<p>ARIA 属性分三类:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[WAI-ARIA] --&gt; B[角色 role&lt;br/&gt;这是什么]&#10;  A --&gt; C[状态 state&lt;br/&gt;当前怎么样·会变]&#10;  A --&gt; D[属性 property&lt;br/&gt;固有特征·少变]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[role=button/dialog/tab/...]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[aria-expanded&lt;br/&gt;aria-checked&lt;br/&gt;aria-selected]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[aria-label&lt;br/&gt;aria-labelledby&lt;br/&gt;aria-haspopup]\">flowchart TD\n  A[WAI-ARIA] --&gt; B[角色 role&lt;br/&gt;这是什么]\n  A --&gt; C[状态 state&lt;br/&gt;当前怎么样·会变]\n  A --&gt; D[属性 property&lt;br/&gt;固有特征·少变]\n  B --&gt; B1[role=button/dialog/tab/...]\n  C --&gt; C1[aria-expanded&lt;br/&gt;aria-checked&lt;br/&gt;aria-selected]\n  D --&gt; D1[aria-label&lt;br/&gt;aria-labelledby&lt;br/&gt;aria-haspopup]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>是否随交互改变</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>角色 role</td>\n<td>这个元素是什么</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>role=&quot;tablist&quot;</code> <code>role=&quot;dialog&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态 state</td>\n<td>它现在是什么状态</td>\n<td>是,需 JS 同步</td>\n<td><code>aria-expanded</code> <code>aria-checked</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性 property</td>\n<td>它有什么固有特征/关系</td>\n<td>通常否</td>\n<td><code>aria-label</code> <code>aria-controls</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>状态与属性的界限不必死记;真正要记住的是:状态会变,所以必须在交互时用 JS 实时更新,否则屏幕阅读器念出的就是过期信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aria-五原则-用之前先背下来\">ARIA 五原则:用之前先背下来</h2><p>W3C 的 ARIA 使用规则有五条,它们是判断「该不该用 ARIA、怎么用」的决策框架:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>能用原生 HTML 就别用 ARIA</strong>。<code>&lt;button&gt;</code> 优于 <code>&lt;div role=&quot;button&quot;&gt;</code>。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/semantic-html\">语义化 HTML</a>「原生优先」原则的延续。</li>\n<li><strong>不要改变原生语义,除非万不得已</strong>。不要写 <code>&lt;h2 role=&quot;tab&quot;&gt;</code>,而应把内容包进去:<code>&lt;div role=&quot;tab&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>所有交互式 ARIA 控件必须可键盘操作</strong>。加了 <code>role=&quot;button&quot;</code> 就必须让它能聚焦并响应键盘——这条直接通向<a href=\"keyboard-focus\">键盘与焦点管理</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>不要给可聚焦元素加 <code>role=&quot;presentation&quot;</code> 或 <code>aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;</code></strong>,那会让它从可访问性树消失,但仍能被 Tab 聚焦,造成「焦点跑到一个屏幕阅读器看不见的地方」的诡异 bug。</li>\n<li><strong>所有交互式元素必须有可访问名称</strong>。没有名称的按钮,屏幕阅读器只会念「按钮」,用户无从判断它干什么。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这五条里,第一条是统帅:绝大多数「ARIA bug」的根因,就是本该用原生元素的地方硬上了 ARIA。有一句业界格言概括得最好:没有 ARIA 比错误的 ARIA 更好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可访问名称是怎么算出来的\">可访问名称是怎么算出来的</h2><p>「可访问名称(accessible name)」是辅助技术朗读元素时说出的那个名字。它的来源不是单一的,而是按一套有优先级的算法计算出来的(Accessible Name and Description Computation)。优先级从高到低:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>aria-labelledby</code>:指向其他元素的 id,用它们的文本拼成名称(优先级最高)。</li>\n<li><code>aria-label</code>:直接写在属性里的字符串。</li>\n<li>元素自身的内容或关联的原生标签(如 <code>&lt;label for&gt;</code>、按钮的文本、图片的 <code>alt</code>)。</li>\n<li><code>title</code> 属性(兜底,不推荐依赖)。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- aria-labelledby 拼接:可访问名称 = &quot;删除 用户报告.pdf&quot; --&gt;&#10;&lt;span id=&quot;act&quot;&gt;删除&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;span id=&quot;file&quot;&gt;用户报告.pdf&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;button aria-labelledby=&quot;act file&quot;&gt;🗑️&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- aria-label 直接命名一个只有图标的按钮 --&gt;&#10;&lt;button aria-label=&quot;关闭对话框&quot;&gt;✕&lt;/button&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- aria-labelledby 拼接:可访问名称 = \"删除 用户报告.pdf\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"act\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>删除&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>用户报告.pdf&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-labelledby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"act file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>🗑️&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- aria-label 直接命名一个只有图标的按钮 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"关闭对话框\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>✕&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>形式化地,设候选来源按优先级为序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = (s_1, s_2, \\dots, s_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>,则可访问名称取首个非空者:<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>name</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{name} = s_k,\\ k = \\min\\{i : s_i \\ne \\varnothing\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">name</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。一个常见且严重的陷阱是:<code>aria-label</code> 会<strong>覆盖</strong>元素的可见文本——若按钮显示「保存」却写了 <code>aria-label=&quot;提交&quot;</code>,语音控制用户说「点击 保存」将无法触发它。这违反 WCAG 2.5.3「标签中包含名称」,规则是:可访问名称应包含可见文本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关系属性-把分散的元素连起来\">关系属性:把分散的元素连起来</h2><p>ARIA 的一大威力是建立元素间的程序化关系,弥补 DOM 结构表达不了的语义:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>aria-controls</code>:此元素控制哪个元素(如标签页控制对应面板)。</li>\n<li><code>aria-describedby</code>:补充描述,常用于把表单错误提示关联到输入框。</li>\n<li><code>aria-owns</code>:在 DOM 不相邻但逻辑上有父子关系时,建立可访问性树上的归属。</li>\n<li><code>aria-activedescendant</code>:在复合控件里指明「当前活跃项」,是 roving tabindex 之外的另一种焦点管理思路(详见<a href=\"keyboard-focus\">键盘与焦点管理</a>)。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些关系属性是<a href=\"accessible-widgets\">可访问组件模式</a>里每个复杂控件(组合框、树、网格)的黏合剂——没有它们,屏幕阅读器就无法理解元素之间「谁控制谁、谁描述谁」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ARIA 的唯一作用是修改可访问性树的角色、状态与关系;它<strong>只改语义,不改行为</strong>,行为得自己用 JS 补。</li>\n<li>三类属性:角色(是什么,不变)、状态(怎么样,随交互变需 JS 同步)、属性(固有特征/关系)。</li>\n<li>ARIA 五原则的核心是第一条「能用原生就别用 ARIA」;没有 ARIA 优于错误的 ARIA。</li>\n<li>可访问名称按 <code>aria-labelledby</code> &gt; <code>aria-label</code> &gt; 原生标签/内容 &gt; <code>title</code> 的优先级计算;<code>aria-label</code> 不应与可见文本矛盾。</li>\n<li>关系属性把分散元素连成逻辑整体,是<a href=\"accessible-widgets\">可访问组件模式</a>的黏合剂;所有交互式 ARIA 控件都必须配套<a href=\"keyboard-focus\">键盘与焦点管理</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ARIA 角色与属性","id":"aria-角色与属性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ARIA 五原则:用之前先背下来","id":"aria-五原则-用之前先背下来"},{"level":2,"text":"可访问名称是怎么算出来的","id":"可访问名称是怎么算出来的"},{"level":2,"text":"关系属性:把分散的元素连起来","id":"关系属性-把分散的元素连起来"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WCAG 标准与法规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/foundations/wcag-standards"},"next":{"title":"键盘与焦点管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/aria/keyboard-focus"}}